          <div class="milestone-detail"><span class="milestone-highlight">Gustavo Santaolalla</span> (2005–2006) and <span class="milestone-highlight">Ludwig Göransson</span> (2023–2024) are the only composers since Waxman and Menken to win in back-to-back years, confirming consecutive wins as a recurring but rare Oscar pattern.</div>
